DESCRIPTION:Join Campus Recreation for an awesome day of stand up paddlebo
 arding! Test your balancing skills as we head to the Round Valley Reservo
 ir for a relaxing\, fun day on the water. \nHow do I sign-up?\n\nRegister
  here or in the Student Rec Center main office\, or over the phone (973-6
 55-3340).\nCost for Students: $10\n\nWhere and when?\n\nSaturday\, Septem
 ber 5\, 2026\n9am - 5pm\nBegins at Student Recreation Center\n\nWhat to b
 ring: Water\, lunch\, bug spray\, sunscreen\, towel and bathing suit \nPo
 tential Hazards: Unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\
 , dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous plants\, and insect bites.\n
 \nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
  https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12526032
