 music\, and time to connect with friends. Come ready to dream big\, get c
 reative\, and put your future in motion! All students are welcome! Commut
 ers need to be signed in with a resident following Residence Life guest r
 egistration procedures.\n\nHosted by: Residence Life\n\nAdditional Inform
