BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a scenic hike along Marshall Hill Road Ruins near 
 Greenwood Lake Airport\, featuring multiple trail loops ranging from 2 to
  6+ miles. Hikers can expect 2–3 hours of exploration through wooded trai
 ls and historic ruins on easy to moderate terrain with rocky\, unpaved pa
 ths and some overgrowth. Wear sturdy shoes and come ready for an adventur
 ous day outdoors in New Jersey.\nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegister here or in
  the Student Rec Center main office\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\n
 Cost for Students: $10\n\nWhere and When?\n\nSeptember 6\, 2026\n10am-5pm
 \nBegins Student Recreation Center\n\nWhat to bring: Water\, sneakers and
  a sense of adventure!\n \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather chang
 es\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous
  plants\, insect bites\, and injury by running\, including sprains\, lace
 rations\, abrasions and fractures.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdd
 itional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/eng
 age/event/12506171
DTEND:20260906T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041743Z
DTSTART:20260906T140000Z
LOCATION:Meet at the Student Recreation Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Greenwood Lake Hike
