CATEGORIES:Weeks of Welcome
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun-filled Labor Day trip to the Clifton Commons
  Shopping Area! Explore one of the largest shopping areas in the area wit
 h Target\, AMC\, Barnes & Noble\, food and more! Whether you're looking t
 o relax\, shop\, or have an adventure\, there's something for everyone.\n
  \nHow do I sign up/attend?\n\n\nThis trip is first come\, first serve. W
 e are limited up to the first 100 students who show up. \nFREE for studen
 ts with a valid Montclair State ID\nAll students are welcome!\n\n\n \n\nT
 his is limited to the first 100 participants. Buses will be running on a 
 loop from Red Hawk Deck to the Clifton Commons starting at 11am.\n\n \nWh
 ere and when?\n\n\nMonday\, September 7th\n11 am - 6 pm\nClifton Commons\
 , Clifton\, New Jersey\n\n\n \n\nBuses will be leaving campus from Red Ha
 wk Deck periodically\, so you can choose a departure time that works best
  for you. Refer to the schedule below.\n\n \nDrop off times:11:00am dropo
 ff12:00pm dropoff\nPickup times:6:00pm pickup7:00pm pickup\n\nStudents ma
 y need to Uber/ Lyft back to campus if they miss the shuttles back. It is
  approximately 5 miles away.\n\n\nHosted by: Residence Life\n\nAdditional
  Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/eve
 nt/12627990
