BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Social
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable adventure to the Pennsylvania Ren
 aissance Faire\, ending with an overnight camping experience under the st
 ars. We will drive down to the faire on Saturday\, then spend the night i
 n tents after\, and return on Sunday. Be ready to journey into a vibrant 
 village filled with knights\, jesters\, artisans\, live performances\, un
 ique shops\, and delicious food. Explore the Faire’s extravagant interpre
 tation of the Renaissance era while enjoying exciting entertainment and m
 emorable experiences with fellow adventurers. Space is limited\, so be su
 re to reserve your spot early. \n \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegister here or
  in the Student Recreation Center main office or over the phone (973-655-
 3340).\nCost for Students: $30 | Faculty/Staff/Guest: $75\n\nWhere and Wh
 en?\n\nSeptember 12th-13th\, 2026\n9am on the 12th and 3pm on the 13th \n
 Departs from Student Recreation Center\n\n \nWhat to Bring: Overnight too
 th brush\, pajamas\, clothes\, sunscreen\, money for personal expenses.\n
  \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaus
 tion\, limited vision\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous plants
 \, insect bites and injury by running\, including sprains\, lacerations\,
  abrasions and fractures.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional I
 nformation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event
 /12506168
DTEND:20260913T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041743Z
DTSTART:20260912T130000Z
LOCATION:Meet at the Student Recreation Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pennsylvania Renaissance Faire and Camping Trip
