DESCRIPTION:\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOur Story - ASE Group\n\n\nOur founder\, Al
 -Nesha Jones\, CPA\, MBA\, MOM\, started ASE Group as the solution she ne
 eded to create freedom and flexibility as a working mom. With over a deca
 de of experience in corporate America\, she understood the importance of 
 streamlining systems\, financial reporting\, and analytics\, and she knew
  it could be done without having to sacrifice being present with her fami
 ly. She was on a personal pursuit for flexibility and financial freedom\,
  and a professional quest to serve her community in an impactful way.\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\nSBUS 255 (School of Business). We look forward to seeing you on
  September 16th. \n\nHosted by: Accounting Society\n\nAdditional Informat
 ion can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/126646
 43
