DESCRIPTION:Adult Recess is an interactive outdoor event designed to give 
 students a fun break from classes while encouraging social interaction\, 
 teamwork\, and friendly competition. Students will be able to participate
  in a variety of childhood-inspired games and activities\, including Four
  in a Row\, Large UNO\, relay races\, balloon challenges\, Guess That Son
 g\, charades\, and Minute to Win It games. The event is free and open to 
 all students\, allowing them to stop by\, play games\, meet new people\, 
 and enjoy a relaxed atmosphere on the Main Quad.\n\nHosted by: Bloomfield
  Zeta Phi Beta Sorority\, Inc.\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
  https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12615714
