CATEGORIES:Weeks of Welcome
DESCRIPTION:Major Kickoff a high-energy\, campus-wide event that transform
 s a traditional majors fair into an interactive and dynamic experience th
 at sets the tone for major exploration. Major Kickoff serves as a central
  hub where exploratory ("undeclared") students can dive into the wide arr
 ay of majors offered at Montclair in a fun and engaging way. Students wil
 l engage with peers\, faculty\, and staff\; discover pathways to get invo
 lved in various programs\; and gain the guidance they need to make confid
 ent\, informed decisions about their major. With the opportunity to decla
 re a major on the spot\, Major Kickoff empowers students to take charge o
 f their academic journey.\nWith over 50 departments\, programs\, clubs\, 
 and more on site\, you never know what you might discover or who you migh
 t meet. Enjoy free food\, games\, music\, and giveaways\, win prizes and 
 T-shirts\, and maybe even discover your major.\nMajor Kickoff is part of 
 Academic Exploration Week\, a longstanding immersive experience presented
  by The Discovery Program. To contact the Discovery Program\, email us at
  discoveryprogram@montclair.edu\, or visit us at montclair.edu/discovery-
 program.\n\nHosted by: The Discovery Program\n\nAdditional Information ca
 n be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12486150
DTEND:20260922T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041743Z
DTSTART:20260922T170000Z
