DESCRIPTION:Think you know your U.S. history\, government\, and pop cultur
 e? Put your knowledge to the test in our high-energy game of Patriotic Tr
 ivia!💥 Join us for a fun and fast-paced showdown where teams will compet
 e in classic Jeopardy style\, answering trivia questions that celebrate a
 ll things America—from the Constitution and civic milestones to iconic mo
 ments and figures that shaped our nation. Bring your A-game and your appe
 tite—yes\, there’s free food\, because life\, liberty\, and the pursuit o
 f happiness tastes better on a full stomach.\nOpen to all students —bring
  your love for democracy\, and maybe even a little friendly competition. 
 Prizes\, bragging rights\, and patriotic pride are on the line. Let’s see
  who really knows their stars and stripes! \n\nHosted by: Civic & Voter E
 ngagement\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.ca
 mpuslabs.com/engage/event/12494891
