DESCRIPTION:\nHello Bears and Redhawks! We want to recognize you\, as all 
 of you are crucial contributors to the Psychology club! Your well wishes\
 , and collaborative spirits encourage peer interactions and build opportu
 nities for student partnerships to be recognized and fostered! We would l
 ike to invite you all to play a game with us: We're Not Really Strangers.
  This game encourages us to reflect upon ourselves and the individuals yo
 u surround yourself with on a weekly basis by prompting personal and some
 times vulnerable questions. This may also encourage earnest conversations
  regarding interpersonal health\, personal introspection\, and more!  Whe
 ther you are a new or pre-existing member of the Psychology community\, w
 e look forward to your participation in our getting to know you event! \n
 \n\nHosted by: Psychology Club\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
  https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12702931
