 ted by Lambda Theta Phi where students will compete in teams in a dominoe
 s tournament. Teams will first compete in smaller groups before the top t
 eams advance to the semifinals and championship round. The event will als
 o include music\, food\, and opportunities for students to socialize whil
 e celebrating the cultural importance of dominoes within the Latino commu
 nity. The goal is to create a fun and welcoming event that brings student
 s together through culture and friendly competition.\n\nHosted by: Lambda
  Theta Phi\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.c
