DESCRIPTION:Join Advocacy and Outreach for our 3rd Annual LGBTQ+ and Disab
 ility History and Awareness Month Flag Raising and Reception — a joyful c
 elebration of identity\, resilience\, and community!\nPride and Progress 
 brings together students\, faculty\, and staff to honor the rich historie
 s and vibrant futures of LGBTQ+ and disability communities. Enjoy an insp
 iring flag-raising ceremony featuring an energetic MC\, powerful speakers
 \, and a special live performance you won’t want to miss.\nAfter the cere
 mony\, the celebration continues with:- Music & vibes- Delicious food- A 
 hands-on craft activity- A photo activation station- Free LGBTQ+ and Disa
 bility Pride flags- Interactive tabling from campus partners\nThis event 
 is about visibility\, solidarity\, and celebration — open to everyone\, i
 ncluding allies! Come as you are\, bring your friends\, and help us raise
  our voices (and our flags!) in honor of progress\, pride\, and community
  power.\n\nHosted by: Advocacy and Outreach\n\nAdditional Information can
  be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12502215
